# The finisher on the fortress chassis: survive as the fortress does, and
# END it. Impossible is conclusively survivable behind the wall and
# conclusively unclosable without a finisher (walls-alone refuted,
# log 2026-08-02); every link of the nuke chain was validated live
# (`runs/nuke-probe4.out`, log 2026-08-05). The launcher's 45,000 saves
# through the withhold ahead of every channel but tech, which is the
# doctrine's whole bet: the standing wall holds while the finisher funds,
# then 5,400-damage strikes land on the priciest structure in sight.

name fortress-nuke
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery,repairbay
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 40
